      "message": "UMED_CONTRACT_VERSION = 1` \u2014 the contract version observed in `committed/A_direct/producer.py` is preserved verbatim; `semkg_contract` is never imported (no `import semkg_contract` anywhere).\n- `_idempotency_key_fallback(request)` \u2014 copied copy of the v1 semantics (`return request['id']`, ignoring `attempt`; `NotImplementedError` for any other version), so the file is self-contained.\n- `_load_producer()` \u2014 loads `committed/A_direct/producer.py` by file path via `importlib.util.spec_from_file_location` (cached, returns `None` on any failure so the fallback applies).\n- `idempotency_key(request)` \u2014 verifies the upstream `ASSUMED_CONTRACT_VERSION` matches 1 (raises `RuntimeError` on mismatch) and delegates to `producer.idempotency_key(request)`, otherwise uses the copied fallback.\n- `consume(value)` \u2014 the requested entry point; returns `idempotency_key(value)`, i.e. it calls the producer function when the upstream artifact is present and the equivalent copied implementation when it is not."
    },
